OL,3,GNEWSANurses vote for industrial action 
OL,4,Aover pay                               
OL,6,FNurses in Northern Ireland have voted  
OL,7,Foverwhelmingly to take industrial      
OL,8,Faction, including strike action, over  
OL,9,Fpay.                                   
OL,11,FThey will take continuous action short 
OL,12,Fof strike from 3 December - this sort  
OL,13,Fof action includes working to rule and 
OL,14,Fa ban on overtime.                     
OL,16,FThe Royal College of Nursing (RCN) said
OL,17,Fit was working with other unions for a 
OL,18,Fcollective day of strike action, which 
OL,19,Fone its leaders said would probably be 
OL,20,Fearly January.                         
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
