OL,3,GNEWSANurses vote for industrial action 
OL,4,Aover pay                               
OL,6,FThe RCN said the industrial action was 
OL,7,Fthe result of the failure of the       
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland Executive and         
OL,9,FDepartment of Health to implement the  
OL,10,F2026-27 pay award.                     
